{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/209132-angels-with-no-cover","id":209132,"title":"Angels with no Cover","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-25T23:32:28-07:00","id":209132,"title":"Angels with no Cover","content":"Okay, something I've noticed is that angels can possess as well as manifest physically, a book even mentions that some angels do their jobs by possessing someone.<br /> <br /> So what happens when one of those angels falls? <br /> <br /> I can see two options: Those new demons are pretty screwed what with having no cover and losing their ability to possess people (unless they buy a specific exploit), or they might become a different kind of demon.<br /> <br /> Instead of manifesting physically, they continue to possess people, they have no physical form without a host, without an exploit of course. <br /> <br /> Anyone see another option, and of the two options I presented which do you like best?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T08:16:46-07:00","id":209317,"title":"","content":"I like the idea that the new Unchained manifests a Cover as they rip all of the infrastructure away that allowed them to create the Open &gt; Fetter &gt; Possess flow. This identity they create could even be identical to the actual victim and could create an interesting story about doppelgangers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T08:19:02-07:00","id":209322,"title":"","content":"That's pretty cook Desolate, I had a player who was the possessing type angel. We just agreed that he took the body of the person he was in at the time of his fall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T08:21:34-07:00","id":209325,"title":"","content":"That was the other option I saw, Minty. I like that too. I can see some players liking the idea of such demons beginning play as one of the Burned, as I believe StSword was describing in his first example though personally I think that makes for a very difficult start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T13:27:15-07:00","id":209496,"title":"","content":"It be a very interesting first game, or a kewl way to introduce a new player to an already on going game. An Angel falls but has no cover and is flailing through the city as the Hunter Angels open up their eager eyes. Can the ring cover up the damage from the Demon? Would they also be trying to find a decent body to make a soul pact with and set things up so the new Demon could take it over. Hell, it be a great story without a PC especially if the Players are in a situation where they could give up the newly Fallen to an Angel to keep the Angel off their backs. <br /> <br /> A newly fallen Demon with the right Exploit could just start off and possess a building and wait until it can make a bargain with someone who frequents the office.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}